    {
      "name": "Pinned Agents tab",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "agents-tab",
      "description": "Pinned natural-width Agents beside independently scrolling projects, all 6px apart. Inactive Agents/project neighbors show the shared divider; selected workspace stays bright. Each group reveals only its own close on hover or focus. Labels are left-aligned with equal 12px icon/close insets. Preview shows settled HTML/CSS appearance; desktop uses motion@14.9.0 from motion/react as recorded in extensions.motion, without a React runtime in this preview.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-agents-strip\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Workbench views\"><div class=\"ds-agents-group ds-agents-agents-group\" data-selected=\"false\" data-divider=\"true\"><button class=\"ds-agents-tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 20l1.3 -3.9c-2.324 -3.437 -1.426 -7.872 2.1 -10.374c3.526 -2.501 8.59 -2.296 11.845 .48c3.255 2.777 3.695 7.266 1.029 10.501c-2.666 3.235 -7.615 4.215 -11.574 2.293l-4.7 1\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-agents-title\">Agents</span></button><button class=\"ds-agents-close\" aria-label=\"Close Chat panel\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6l-12 12\"/><path d=\"M6 6l12 12\"/></svg></button></div><div class=\"ds-agents-projects\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Project tabs\"><div class=\"ds-agents-group ds-agents-project-group\" data-selected=\"false\" data-divider=\"false\"><button class=\"ds-agents-tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" title=\"local · main · /example/moonbase\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 4h4l3 3h7a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2h-14a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2v-11a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-agents-title\">moonbase · main</span></button><button class=\"ds-agents-close\" aria-label=\"Close checkout /example/moonbase\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6l-12 12\"/><path d=\"M6 6l12 12\"/></svg></button></div><div class=\"ds-agents-group ds-agents-project-group\" data-selected=\"true\" data-divider=\"false\"><button class=\"ds-agents-tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" title=\"local · main · /example/workspace\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 4h4l3 3h7a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2h-14a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2v-11a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-agents-title\">workspace · main</span></button><button class=\"ds-agents-close\" aria-label=\"Close checkout /example/workspace\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6l-12 12\"/><path d=\"M6 6l12 12\"/></svg></button></div><button class=\"ds-agents-open\" aria-label=\"Open checkout\" title=\"Open project\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5l0 14\"/><path d=\"M5 12l14 0\"/></svg></button></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-agents-strip {position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:40px;min-height:40px;padding:4px 14px 4px 86px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#161618;overflow-x:hidden;-webkit-app-region:drag;} .ds-agents-projects {display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;min-width:0;overflow-x:auto;} .ds-agents-group {position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;min-width:0;height:32px;gap:0;padding:0 8px;box-sizing:border-box;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:#97979f;-webkit-app-region:no-drag;} .ds-agents-agents-group {z-index:1;flex-shrink:0;align-self:center;} .ds-agents-project-group {flex:0 0 216px;} .ds-agents-group:hover {background:#222224;} .ds-agents-group:hover,.ds-agents-group:focus-within {color:#e5e5e7;} .ds-agents-group[data-selected=\"true\"] {background:#28282b;color:#e5e5e7;} .ds-agents-group[data-selected=\"true\"]:hover {background:#303034;} .ds-agents-group[data-divider=\"true\"]::after {content:\"\";position:absolute;right:-4px;top:8px;width:1px;height:16px;background:#343438;pointer-events:none;} .ds-agents-tab,.ds-agents-close,.ds-agents-open {font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;border:0;border-radius:6px;background:transparent;white-space:nowrap;box-shadow:none;cursor:pointer;-webkit-app-region:no-drag;} .ds-agents-tab {min-width:0;height:32px;gap:8px;padding:0 4px;text-align:left;color:inherit;} .ds-agents-project-group .ds-agents-tab {flex:1;height:100%;} .ds-agents-agents-group .ds-agents-tab {font-weight:600;} .ds-agents-project-group .ds-agents-title {flex:1;min-width:0;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;} .ds-agents-close {flex:0 0 24px;justify-content:center;width:24px;height:24px;padding:4px;box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;} .ds-agents-group[data-selected=\"true\"] .ds-agents-close,.ds-agents-group:hover .ds-agents-close,.ds-agents-group:focus-within .ds-agents-close {opacity:1;pointer-events:auto;} .ds-agents-open {align-self:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;width:30px;height:30px;padding:7px;box-sizing:border-box;color:#b2b2b8;} .ds-agents-close:hover:not(:disabled),.ds-agents-open:hover:not(:disabled) {background:#2b2b2e;} .ds-agents-tab:focus-visible,.ds-agents-close:focus-visible,.ds-agents-open:focus-visible {outline:2px solid #ededf0;outline-offset:2px;} .ds-agents-tab:focus:not(:focus-visible),.ds-agents-close:focus:not(:focus-visible),.ds-agents-open:focus:not(:focus-visible) {outline:none;} .ds-agents-tab:disabled,.ds-agents-open:disabled {opacity:0.55;cursor:not-allowed;} .ds-agents-close:disabled {cursor:not-allowed;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Project tab",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "project-tab",
      "description": "216px project groups with left-aligned truncated labels, equal 12px icon/close insets and retained close space. Selected Agents has no adjacent divider; inactive project neighbors do. All gaps are 6px; hover/focus brightens only that group and reveals its close. Content is illustrative. Preview shows settled HTML/CSS appearance; desktop Motion behavior is recorded in extensions.motion, without a React runtime in this preview.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-project-strip\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Workbench views\"><div class=\"ds-project-group ds-project-agents-group\" data-selected=\"true\" data-divider=\"false\"><button class=\"ds-project-tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 20l1.3 -3.9c-2.324 -3.437 -1.426 -7.872 2.1 -10.374c3.526 -2.501 8.59 -2.296 11.845 .48c3.255 2.777 3.695 7.266 1.029 10.501c-2.666 3.235 -7.615 4.215 -11.574 2.293l-4.7 1\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-project-title\">Agents</span></button><button class=\"ds-project-close\" aria-label=\"Close Chat panel\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6l-12 12\"/><path d=\"M6 6l12 12\"/></svg></button></div><div class=\"ds-project-projects\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Project tabs\"><div class=\"ds-project-group ds-project-project-group\" data-selected=\"false\" data-divider=\"true\"><button class=\"ds-project-tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" title=\"local · main · /example/moonbase\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 4h4l3 3h7a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2h-14a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2v-11a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-project-title\">moonbase · main</span></button><button class=\"ds-project-close\" aria-label=\"Close checkout /example/moonbase\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6l-12 12\"/><path d=\"M6 6l12 12\"/></svg></button></div><div class=\"ds-project-group ds-project-project-group\" data-selected=\"false\" data-divider=\"false\"><button class=\"ds-project-tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" title=\"local · main · /example/workspace\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 4h4l3 3h7a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2h-14a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2v-11a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-project-title\">workspace · main</span></button><button class=\"ds-project-close\" aria-label=\"Close checkout /example/workspace\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6l-12 12\"/><path d=\"M6 6l12 12\"/></svg></button></div><button class=\"ds-project-open\" aria-label=\"Open checkout\" title=\"Open project\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5l0 14\"/><path d=\"M5 12l14 0\"/></svg></button></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-project-strip {position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:40px;min-height:40px;padding:4px 14px 4px 86px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#161618;overflow-x:hidden;-webkit-app-region:drag;} .ds-project-projects {display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;min-width:0;overflow-x:auto;} .ds-project-group {position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;min-width:0;height:32px;gap:0;padding:0 8px;box-sizing:border-box;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:#97979f;-webkit-app-region:no-drag;} .ds-project-agents-group {z-index:1;flex-shrink:0;align-self:center;} .ds-project-project-group {flex:0 0 216px;} .ds-project-group:hover {background:#222224;} .ds-project-group:hover,.ds-project-group:focus-within {color:#e5e5e7;} .ds-project-group[data-selected=\"true\"] {background:#28282b;color:#e5e5e7;} .ds-project-group[data-selected=\"true\"]:hover {background:#303034;} .ds-project-group[data-divider=\"true\"]::after {content:\"\";position:absolute;right:-4px;top:8px;width:1px;height:16px;background:#343438;pointer-events:none;} .ds-project-tab,.ds-project-close,.ds-project-open {font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;border:0;border-radius:6px;background:transparent;white-space:nowrap;box-shadow:none;cursor:pointer;-webkit-app-region:no-drag;} .ds-project-tab {min-width:0;height:32px;gap:8px;padding:0 4px;text-align:left;color:inherit;} .ds-project-project-group .ds-project-tab {flex:1;height:100%;} .ds-project-agents-group .ds-project-tab {font-weight:600;} .ds-project-project-group .ds-project-title {flex:1;min-width:0;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;} .ds-project-close {flex:0 0 24px;justify-content:center;width:24px;height:24px;padding:4px;box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;} .ds-project-group[data-selected=\"true\"] .ds-project-close,.ds-project-group:hover .ds-project-close,.ds-project-group:focus-within .ds-project-close {opacity:1;pointer-events:auto;} .ds-project-open {align-self:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;width:30px;height:30px;padding:7px;box-sizing:border-box;color:#b2b2b8;} .ds-project-close:hover:not(:disabled),.ds-project-open:hover:not(:disabled) {background:#2b2b2e;} .ds-project-tab:focus-visible,.ds-project-close:focus-visible,.ds-project-open:focus-visible {outline:2px solid #ededf0;outline-offset:2px;} .ds-project-tab:focus:not(:focus-visible),.ds-project-close:focus:not(:focus-visible),.ds-project-open:focus:not(:focus-visible) {outline:none;} .ds-project-tab:disabled,.ds-project-open:disabled {opacity:0.55;cursor:not-allowed;} .ds-project-close:disabled {cursor:not-allowed;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Conversation row",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "conversation-row",
      "description": "Two-line saved conversation with folder basename and date. Content is illustrative.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-conversation\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-chat-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"ds-chat-summary\"><span class=\"ds-chat-title\">Review the desktop shell and editor</span><span class=\"ds-chat-folder\">moonbase</span></span><time class=\"ds-chat-date\" datetime=\"2026-01-01\">Jan 1</time></button>",
      "css": ".ds-conversation {font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#e5e5e7;background:#222224;border:1px solid #343438;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 10px;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:start;gap:10px;width:100%;text-align:left;min-width:0;padding:9px 12px;border-width:0;border-radius:7px;background:transparent;color:#b2b2b8;} .ds-conversation:hover:not(:disabled) {background:#2b2b2e;} .ds-conversation:focus-visible {outline:2px solid #ededf0;outline-offset:2px;} .ds-conversation:focus:not(:focus-visible) {outline:none;} .ds-conversation:disabled {opacity:0.55;cursor:not-allowed;} .ds-conversation[aria-pressed=\"true\"] {background:#28282b;color:#e5e5e7;} .ds-conversation[aria-pressed=\"true\"]:hover:not(:disabled) {background:#303034;} .ds-chat-dot {margin-top:7px;width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#97979f;flex-shrink:0;} .ds-chat-summary {display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;min-width:0;} .ds-chat-title,.ds-chat-folder {overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;} .ds-chat-folder {font-size:12px;font-weight:400;color:#97979f;} .ds-chat-date {font-size:11px;color:#97979f;margin-left:auto;white-space:nowrap;flex-shrink:0;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Conversation composer",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "composer",
      "description": "Source-sized textarea, compact model and reasoning selectors, circular Send and required tool notice. Selector content is illustrative.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-compose-area\"><form class=\"ds-composer\"><textarea class=\"ds-message\" aria-label=\"Message\" placeholder=\"Ask anything, or describe what you want to build…\"></textarea><div class=\"ds-compose-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-model\">Demo model <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6l6 -6\"/></svg></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-model ds-effort\">Extra high <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6l6 -6\"/></svg></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-compose-send\" aria-label=\"Send message\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5l0 14\"/><path d=\"M18 11l-6 -6\"/><path d=\"M6 11l6 -6\"/></svg></button></div></form><div class=\"ds-compose-help\"><span>Local tools can access files outside the working folder.</span><span>⌘ / Ctrl Enter</span></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-compose-area {font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;color:#e5e5e7;width:calc(100% - 48px);max-width:640px;margin:12px auto 8px;} .ds-composer {display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:12px;background:#222224;border:1px solid #343438;border-radius:18px;} .ds-composer:focus-within {border-color:#97979f;} .ds-message {font-family:inherit;color:#e5e5e7;caret-color:#ededf0;width:100%;min-width:0;max-width:100%;resize:none;min-height:48px;max-height:25vh;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;background:transparent;border:0;border-radius:0;padding:0;} .ds-message::placeholder {color:#97979f;opacity:1;} .ds-message:focus-visible {outline:none;} .ds-compose-actions {display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;min-height:32px;} .ds-model {font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#e5e5e7;background:#222224;border:1px solid #343438;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 10px;cursor:pointer;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:transparent;color:#b2b2b8;border-color:transparent;} .ds-model:hover:not(:disabled) {background:#2b2b2e;} .ds-model:focus-visible {outline:2px solid #ededf0;outline-offset:2px;} .ds-model:focus:not(:focus-visible) {outline:none;} .ds-model:disabled {opacity:0.55;cursor:not-allowed;}.ds-compose-send {font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#e5e5e7;background:#222224;border:1px solid #343438;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 10px;cursor:pointer;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;width:32px;height:32px;padding:7px;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:#ededf0;color:#19191b;} .ds-compose-send:hover:not(:disabled) {background:#ffffff;} .ds-compose-send:focus-visible {outline:2px solid #ededf0;outline-offset:2px;} .ds-compose-send:focus:not(:focus-visible) {outline:none;} .ds-compose-send:disabled {opacity:0.55;cursor:not-allowed;} .ds-compose-help {display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;padding:10px 8px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;color:#97979f;} .ds-effort {flex-shrink:0;width:116px;justify-content:space-between;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Model popup",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "popup",
      "description": "Shared elevated portal surface and focusable options. Labels are illustrative.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-popup\"><div class=\"ds-options\"><button class=\"ds-option\">Configured model</button><button class=\"ds-option\">Another configured model</button></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-popup {font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;width:min(360px, calc(100vw - 32px));border:1px solid #343438;border-radius:12px;background:#222224;color:#e5e5e7;overflow:hidden;scrollbar-color:#343438 #222224;scrollbar-width:thin;} .ds-options {max-height:min(340px, 45vh);overflow-y:auto;padding:6px;border-top:1px solid #29292d;} .ds-option {font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;width:100%;text-align:left;padding:12px;border:0;border-radius:7px;background:transparent;color:#e5e5e7;outline-offset:-2px;} .ds-option:hover:not(:disabled),.ds-option:focus-visible {background:#2b2b2e;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "File tree row",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "file-row",
      "description": "Official Tabler IconFile, IconFolder and IconFolderOpen at 16px/stroke 1.5, with a reserved 16px disclosure column and aligned names at each depth. Existing 28px row geometry, selection, active-label and focus states remain distinct; expansion is illustrative.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tree\" role=\"tree\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Files\" aria-multiselectable=\"true\" aria-activedescendant=\"ds-file-welcome\"><div class=\"ds-file-row ds-file-level-1\" role=\"treeitem\" aria-level=\"1\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-disclosure ds-disclosure-open\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 6l6 6l-6 6\"/></svg></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 19l2.757 -7.351a1 1 0 0 1 .936 -.649h12.307a1 1 0 0 1 .986 1.164l-.996 5.211a2 2 0 0 1 -1.964 1.625h-14.026a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2v-11a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2h4l3 3h7a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-file-label\">src</span></div><div class=\"ds-file-row ds-file-level-2\" role=\"treeitem\" id=\"ds-file-welcome\" aria-level=\"2\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-current=\"true\" data-focused=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-disclosure\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 3v4a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h4\"/><path d=\"M17 21h-10a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2v-14a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2h7l5 5v11a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-file-label ds-file-active\">welcome.ts</span></div><div class=\"ds-file-row ds-file-level-1\" role=\"treeitem\" aria-level=\"1\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"ds-disclosure\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 6l6 6l-6 6\"/></svg></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 4h4l3 3h7a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2h-14a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2v-11a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-file-label\">tests</span></div><div class=\"ds-file-row ds-file-level-1\" role=\"treeitem\" aria-level=\"1\" aria-selected=\"false\"><span class=\"ds-disclosure\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 3v4a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h4\"/><path d=\"M17 21h-10a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2v-14a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2h7l5 5v11a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-file-label\">README.md</span></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-tree {font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;background:#161618;overflow:auto;min-height:80px;outline-offset:-2px;} .ds-tree:focus-visible {outline:2px solid #ededf0;} .ds-file-row {display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;min-height:28px;height:28px;padding:3px 6px;box-sizing:border-box;cursor:default;font-size:13px;color:#b2b2b8;background:transparent;} .ds-file-level-2 {padding-left:22px;} .ds-file-row:hover {background:#222224;} .ds-file-row[aria-selected=\"true\"] {background:#28282b;} .ds-file-row[aria-selected=\"true\"]:hover {background:#303034;} .ds-disclosure {display:inline-flex;width:16px;height:16px;flex-shrink:0;} .ds-disclosure-open {transform:rotate(90deg);} .ds-file-label {overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;} .ds-file-active {color:#e5e5e7;} .ds-tree:focus .ds-file-row[data-focused=\"true\"] {outline:1px solid #ededf0;outline-offset:-1px;}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Quiet Workbench",
    "overview": "The Quiet Workbench follows the user-pinned Cursor reference: cool charcoal surfaces, platform typography, compact outline controls and a spacious conversation measure. This is an Operate surface. Familiar navigation, readable content and visible state define its character. The latest pinned canvas and sidebar colors supersede earlier palette explorations.\n\nThe shell stays visually flat. Tonal steps separate navigation, content, controls and selection; light neutral focus and Send treatments identify action. Desktop conversation and editor views share this language while retaining their own layout and interaction owners. The reference supplies the visual quality bar; no catalog world was adopted. The build is code-led and ships no raster design assets.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Exact charcoal canvas and sidebar levels with coordinated cool-neutral controls.",
      "Platform sans for interface text and a separate monospace stack for code.",
      "Compact controls, generous conversation space and restrained tonal hierarchy.",
      "Shared StyleX appearance with Base UI interactions and native macOS window controls."
    ],
